l": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2022-09-02T11:10:45Z"}, "message": "Conditional check for HorizontalPodAutoscaler api version in helm chart (#1635)\n\n- See deprecation guide https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/deprecation-guide/ outline HorizontalPodAutoscaler api version deprecations\r\n- autoscaling/v2beta2 and autoscaling/v2 seem to both be available since kubernetes v1.23 so going straight to use the stable api version\r\n- autoscaling/v1beta1 will no longer be served in v1.25 (apparently release a few days ago https://kubernetes.io/releases/_print/#release-v1-25)\r\n- Deprecation guide doesn't mention any notable changes, so perceiving no other changes required here\r\n- Utilising helm [built-in objects](https://helm.sh/docs/chart_template_guide/builtin_objects/) for capabilities to conditionally use the newer version if it's available\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Gary Pennington <gary@apollographql.com>", "tree": {"sha": "20507fa6567524b8fc5f6c1b8fc02697e3b93328", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/unkuseni/apollo-router/git/trees/20507fa6567524b8fc5f6c1b8fc02697e3b93328"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/unkuseni/apollo-router/git/commits/393c69907a4b8538c4e8096670e7f895d481b142", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJjEeS1CRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAA54IAGwWqGzVknOsxZtgCiQvZzE/\nDvG3OTAs4Ow4di3vAHwluoTjlH9UR9fEDOhTUpVLV5BDK2fllXn1Fb8NbQQ7NRoQ\nacdLTYIapZfhLJn9cFellwrAwk8ELiA53AVEpe0R7wn2t+667yOiK1PKyez+EF4R\nfeZwdw8UxLWPk0QrxftWmxcf+AR3fstf15yElQ1u7mTnKQM3+LjpkIcUAAwb/jLG\nttW/b0ZNpqNl5K4la/0cPex4oBv6bscvkkxEKrs357TP4VWSdY5/e7FwfeJXEq+6\nAdqhkXs9YSXZHGUCi6beK6/UsXZkeptD1rG4YoseLXQan0zJqWQVCCzSk6fDI1g=\n=yhn5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 20507fa6567524b8fc5f6c1b8fc02697e3b93328\nparent 916f12381a55e910d1b578901833d557af45bfe5\nauthor Damien Pontifex <damien.pontifex@gmail.com> 1662117045 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1662117045 +0100\n\nConditional check for HorizontalPodAutoscaler api version in helm chart (#1635)\n\n- See deprecation guide https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/deprecation-guide/ outline HorizontalPodAutoscaler api version deprecations\r\n- autoscaling/v2beta2 and autoscaling/v2 seem to both be available since kubernetes v1.23 so going straight to use the stable api version\r\n- autoscaling/v1beta1 will no longer be served in v1.25 (apparently release a few days ago https://kubernetes.io/releases/_print/#release-v1-25)\r\n- Deprecation guide doesn't mention any notable changes, so perceiving no other changes required here\r\n- Utilising helm [built-in objects](https://helm.sh/docs/chart_template_guide/builtin_objects/) for capabilities to conditionally use the newer version if it's available\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Gary Pennington <gary@apollographql.com>", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/unkuseni/apollo-router/commits/393c69907a4b8538c4e8096670e7f895d481b142", "html_url": "https://github.com/unkuseni/apollo-router/commit/393c69907a4b8538c4e8096670e7f895d481b142", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/unkuseni/apollo-router/commits/393c69907a4b8538c4e8096670e7f895d481b142/comments", "author": {"login": "damienpontifex", "id": 1321276, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjEyNzY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1321276?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/damienpontifex", "html_url": "https://github.com/damienpontifex", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/damienpontifex/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/damienpontifex/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/damienpontifex/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/damienpontifex/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/damienpontifex/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dam